gh_leaders.pdf"},{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternativeformats@communities.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"6aa02015c5796a7a179c6460","filename":"Local_government_reorganisation_-_programme_review_and_decisions_withdrawal_letter_to_Surrey_leaders.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":175390,"filename":"Local_government_reorganisation_-_programme_review_and_decisions_withdrawal_letter_to_Surrey_leaders.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9493640","isbn":"","number_of_pages":2,"title":"Local government reorganisation: programme review and decisions withdrawal letter to Surrey leaders","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6aa02015c5796a7a179c6460/Local_government_reorganisation_-_programme_review_and_decisions_withdrawal_letter_to_Surrey_leaders.pdf"},{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternativeformats@communities.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"6aa0202b62ec7fe7bedf517f","filename":"Local_government_reorganisation_-_programme_review_and_decisions_withdrawal_letter_to_West_Sussex_leaders.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":175903,"filename":"Local_government_reorganisation_-_programme_review_and_decisions_withdrawal_letter_to_West_Sussex_leaders.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9493646","isbn":"","number_of_pages":2,"title":"Local government reorganisation: programme review and decisions withdrawal letter to West Sussex leaders","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6aa0202b62ec7fe7bedf517f/Local_government_reorganisation_-_programme_review_and_decisions_withdrawal_letter_to_West_Sussex_leaders.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>On 7 September 2026, the Minister for Local Government, Devolution and Regional Growth wrote to local government reorganisation council leaders.</p>\n\n<p>This letter announced the withdrawal of the current decisions for:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Essex, Southend-on-Sea and Thurrock</li>\n  <li>Hampshire, Isle of Wight, Portsmouth and Southampton</li>\n  <li>Norfolk</li>\n  <li>Suffolk</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>It also announced a rapid review of the local government reorganisation programme. This includes decisions taken in July 2026 and the 2 outstanding areas awaiting decisions. This does not impact the decision taken in Surrey.</p>\n\n<p>The Secretary of State also announced these measures in an oral statement to Parliament on 7 September 2026.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"Letters to leaders in Cambridgeshire and Peterborough, Surrey and West Sussex added.","public_timestamp":"2026-09-08T15:34:25Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-09-07T16:01:00Z"}],"document_type_label":"Correspondence","emphasised_organisations":["1390d07f-12b3-4f55-9dd5-fec5fd9e3649"],"featured_attachments":["9493622","9493623","9493640","9493646"],"first_public_at":"2026-09-07T17:01:00.000+01:00","national_applicability":{"england":{"applicable":true,"label":"England"},"northern_ireland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Northern Ireland"},"scotland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Scotland"},"wales":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Wales"}},"political":true,"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"correspondence","first_published_at":"2026-09-07T17:01:00+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/local-government-reorganisation-programme-review-and-decisions-withdrawal-letter-to-council-leaders","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/publications/local-government-reorganisation-programme-review-and-decisions-withdrawal-letter-to-council-leaders","base_path":"/government/publications/local-government-reorg